; ticker.inc - the text that runs through the foot of the title and the
; choice of a map (engine.s, tk_text): 6.25 characters a second, so
; these 546 take 87 seconds. Two spaces between sentences. Letters both
; cases, digits, . , : ; - + / ! ? ( ) ' and spaces.
        .byte "TRAIN SCHEDULE - Rail Route from the PC, cut down to a Commodore "
        .byte "Plus/4.  Run the signal box: set routes from signal to signal "
        .byte "and keep every train on time.  Stops on time score points - "
        .byte "delays, wrong platforms and red signals cost them.  Earn a star "
        .byte "on a map to unlock the next.  Stick or cursor keys move the "
        .byte "pointer.  Fire on a signal, then on a blinking one: the route is "
        .byte "set.  Fire on a train: its timetable.  Fire+up or Z: zoom.  "
        .byte "Fire+left/right or -/+: speed.  F1: music.  Music: Radetzky "
        .byte "March and Rail Road Waltz.  Have a good journey!  "
